Z||000000||V8Fiero||08-20-2000||03:55 PM||||I recently purchased a GT Fascia and bumper for my 84 se. Was wondering what else I needed to add on to these to make them factory. I have put them on the car and KNOW there is more needed. (besides the inner fenders and lower air dam for the front). Any one have these parts that I need? TIA<P>Scooter||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||08-20-2000||04:05 PM||||As you mentioned....you'll need the inner fender wells and lower air dam/deflector.  You may also need the honeycomb absorber thing too.  I believe different years/models had different absorbers.  If your car has the ribbed side molding and the new GT stuff has the smooth, then you will need the smooth style sidemarkers as well.<P>That's pretty much it.<P>I have a GT lower air dam and can get a set of inner fender liners too.  LMK if you still need these.||||reg||1
